    "prompt": "\ufeffCreate an ORIGINAL complete hand-painted 2D sprite master sheet of an ELDER DRAGON epic boss for Heroes of Might and Magic III, inspired conceptually by League of Legends Elder Dragon. Exactly 4 columns by 4 rows, SIXTEEN separated whole-body poses, equal cells, constant body scale, huge transparent gutters, genuinely transparent background. Right-facing low three-quarter battlefield perspective, light upper left. A gigantic ancient LIVING wyvern with two massive hindlegs and paired muscular wing forelimbs. Dominant heavy chest, long powerful arched neck, angular charcoal-slate scale armor, pale bone-white crown horns sweeping back in jagged ridges, long white-silver bristled mane from jaw down neck, thick plate-armored whip tail with jagged ivory spines. Oversized hooked ivory tusklike chin horns, sharp broad toothy muzzle, deep cyan eyes. Broad leathery dark desaturated teal wing membranes, very restrained blue-green highlights on veins and fingertips. Clearly living flesh beneath rough matte scales, not undead, not a skeleton, not metal. Boss has a grand heavy imposing silhouette distinct from slender elemental drakes: enormous shoulder crest, thick supporting legs, old scarred hide. Original HoMM3 textured miniature painting, compact readable values, earthy restrained contrast, no photorealism, 3D rendering, vector, anime, plastic, bloom or splashart. NO shadow, aura, smoke, spells, breath, projectiles, saddle, text, grid, labels or scenery. Each subject entirely within its own cell including every tail tip, wingtip and horn, large empty gutters. ROW 1 four grounded folded-wing idle breathing poses, feet planted; small neck/body motion. ROW 2 four ordered real AIRBORNE FLIGHT wingbeats: upstroke fully high, forward downstroke, wings fully down, recovery upstroke; heavy body carried above tucked hindclaws. ROW 3 four TAKEOFF phases: deeply crouch, wings unfold upward, legs spring off ground, airborne wings down. ROW 4 four LANDING phases: approach feet tucked, wings flare and feet extend, claws touch ground, wings fold and weight settles. Genuine anatomical articulation, no repeated static body transform. Make the wings HUGE yet fully contained in cells with clear air between neighboring dragons.\n",
